@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

### Saúde da API e do banco
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Usuários do seletor "Entrando como" (sem identidade)
# @name users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

@marcos = {{users.response.body.$.users[0].id}}
@ana = {{users.response.body.$.users[1].id}}
@bruno = {{users.response.body.$.users[2].id}}
@carla = {{users.response.body.$.users[3].id}}

### Quadro do gestor, por prioridade
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities
X-User-Id: {{marcos}}

### Quadro da Ana com as perdidas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities?includeLost=true
X-User-Id: {{ana}}

### Precisam de atenção (Atrasadas + Escalonadas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities?situation=ATTENTION&situation=ESCALATED
X-User-Id: {{marcos}}

### Busca sem acento, ordenada por valor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities?q=clinica&sort=value
X-User-Id: {{marcos}}

### Filtro por responsável (só gestor) e Fechamento sem corte
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities?ownerId={{bruno}}&allClosed=true
X-User-Id: {{marcos}}

### Detalhe com timeline (OPP-2004, escalonada)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/2004
X-User-Id: {{carla}}

### Criar (gestor escolhe alguém do time)
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities
X-User-Id: {{marcos}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Padaria Nova",
  "contactName": "Seu Zé",
  "ownerId": {{ana}}
}

@newId = {{created.response.body.$.id}}

### Mover para Orçamento sem valor e itens (422 com missing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{newId}}/move
X-User-Id: {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStage": "BUDGET_PRESENTATION" }

### Completar dados e mover
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{newId}}/move
X-User-Id: {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toStage": "BUDGET_PRESENTATION",
  "complete": {
    "estimatedValue": 1200,
    "items": [{ "description": "Sacola ecológica", "quantity": 100, "unitValue": 12 }]
  }
}

### Movimento proibido (409 ONLY_FROM_FORECAST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{newId}}/move
X-User-Id: {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStage": "CLOSING" }

### Editar contato, datas e itens
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{newId}}
X-User-Id: {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactPhone": "(11) 98888-7777",
  "eventDate": "2026-11-20",
  "items": [{ "description": "Sacola ecológica", "quantity": 150, "unitValue": 12 }],
  "estimatedValue": 1800
}

### Marcar como retornado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{newId}}/follow-up
X-User-Id: {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "WHATSAPP", "summary": "Cliente pediu nova cor", "nextDate": "2026-10-20" }

### Adiar (o 2º seguido escala)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{newId}}/snooze
X-User-Id: {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "until": "2026-10-22", "reason": "Cliente em viagem" }

### Comentar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{newId}}/comments
X-User-Id: {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Cliente pediu amostra" }

### Marcar como perdida
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{newId}}/lose
X-User-Id: {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "COMPETITOR", "detail": "Fechou com a Brindex" }

### Sem identidade (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities
